{"id":"wb-6-650","name":"祖师庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"洛阳老子纪念馆","text":"洛阳老子纪念馆，中国河南省洛阳市的一家国有专题博物馆。该馆依托全国重点文物保护单位祖师庙建立，位于老城区北大街1号。该馆为国家二级博物馆洛阳民俗博物馆的下辖博物馆，2012年建成开放。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B4%9B%E9%98%B3%E8%80%81%E5%AD%90%E7%BA%AA%E5%BF%B5%E9%A6%86","revisionId":93825238,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93825238","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/df800a7792c12cc4b959f77c.jpg","title":"Luoyang_Laozi_Memorial_Hall.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Luoyang_Laozi_Memorial_Hall.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/56/Luoyang_Laozi_Memorial_Hall.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Baomi","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​洛阳老子纪念馆","width":320,"height":180}}